  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "How this project is fed",
      "description": "Cases arrive here when somebody reports content or conduct. A case carries the reporter's own words and references to what they reported.\n\n**What the fields mean.** `subject_user`, `subject_guild`, `resource_type` and `resource_id` are references, not content. Reaching what they point at is a break-glass grant, which is time-bound and records why it was taken.\n\n**Closing a case** means a decision was made and recorded. Say what was done, even when the answer is that nothing was.\n\nYou can restructure this project however you like. The binding only names the project.",
